thub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106231.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-28T14:48:18Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11541. Supersedes #104954.\r\n\r\nThis PR converts the Movie Maker button in the editor run bar from a simple toggle to a dropdown button (MenuButton) with a checkbox item to enable or disable Movie Maker mode, and another item to quickly open the Project Settings section for Movie Maker.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52c69d00-4a28-4eeb-bdb7-6ce15a7f2008\r\n\r\nThe previous PR (#104954) contained a *bit* more functionality than this - it had an output filepath entry field in the dropdown itself - but I found it was finicky and didn't save much time. This is a safer implementation, in my opinion.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106231/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106231/timeline","performed_vi